{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主紫微斗数命盘信息，命宫在亥，主星巨门旺，身宫在丑，主星天梁旺。命主生于辛丑年，天干四化为巨门化禄、太阳化权、文曲化科、文昌化忌。身宫太阳化权与天梁同宫，太阳在丑为陷地，虽化权但本身力弱，天梁旺可解厄，构成“阳梁权印”但略显不足。命宫巨门化禄，亥为旺地，幼年根基尚可。命主为阴男，五行局木三局，大限逆行，3岁起运，命宫大限为3-12岁，13岁转入戌宫大限。大限交接之年最易引发动荡与灾祸。选项D对应1974年，流年甲寅，太岁在寅，与命宫亥相合，且甲干使太阳化忌，直接冲入身宫丑，与生年太阳化权形成权忌交战。太阳主心血、父缘，化忌在身宫引发凶象，天梁旺虽能解厄，但权忌剧烈冲突易致凶劫。此年正值13岁大限初换，故灾劫发生可能性最高。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b2b_R2_P1_G1\\details_2024_b2b_R2_P1_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 91973, "response_id": "c8541c47-62aa-448b-8fd3-d53f7a403a0a", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 228, "completion_tokens": 5383, "total_tokens": 5611, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5102}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 100}}
